evaluation:
  warmup_start: "2025-11-01T00:00:00Z"
  development_start: "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  development_end: "2026-08-01T00:00:00Z"
  holdout_policy: >-
    Do not open or evaluate 2026-08 onward data in this research. 2026-Jan-Jul
    is already-observed historical development and is not confirmatory.
  one_fixed_signal: >-
    On each fully completed 1h candle at start timestamp t, calculate signed
    taker quote imbalance = (2*taker_buy_quote_volume-quote_volume)/quote_volume.
    Require denominator > 0, abs(imbalance) >= 95th percentile of PREVIOUS 720
    valid hourly abs imbalances of the same symbol (shift one), candle
    close/open-1 has the same sign as imbalance, and completed hour quote volume
    >= PRIOR 24h mean quote volume (shift one). Positive imbalance fades SHORT;
    negative fades LONG. Do not add price-return threshold, ML, or tuning.
  timing: >-
    Candle timestamp t is its start; its content becomes known after t+1h.
    To avoid same-boundary fill assumptions, submit on engine callback for bar
    timestamp t+1h and use NEXT_BAR OPEN fill at t+2h. Close at open t+6h
    (exact 4h hold). Only use market-visible known schedule to avoid entry
    or holdings overlapping an 8h funding settlement. Audit actual
    settlements after execution; fail closed on any crossing. Skip competing
    new signals while a symbol is held or has pending orders.
  sizing: >-
    Start $500. Target 0.4 times current equity notional per instrument.
    Maximum two simultaneous positions and gross marked exposure <= 1.0x.
    No leverage, no liquidation assumptions, fractional contracts in simulator.
  cost_handling: >-
    Use ml4t.backtest Engine Strategy with NEXT_BAR OPEN, 4.5 bps taker fee
    per fill and 1.5 bps modeled slippage per fill; fee+slippage
    12 bps round trip. No additional spread estimated due to missing L1.
    Avoid all funding settlements by scheduled entry-window filter, audit
    actual event timestamps, and refuse if a held trade crossed funding.
  output: >-
    One strategy, gross and net cost decomposition and cash baseline; report
    per-symbol results, continuous daily equity Sharpe and maximum drawdown,
    number of candidate signals, actual trades, win rate, gaps, rejected
    orders, and data SHA256. Preserve every failure and limitations.
baseline: >-
  Zero-trade cash at $500; gross-cost version is attribution for the SAME
  frozen strategy, not an additional tuned variant.
costs:
  commission_bps: 4.5
  slippage_bps: 1.5
  funding_included: false
  assumptions: >-
    Binance VIP 0 taker-fee and conservative but uncalibrated execution
    slippage. No explicit spread or impact. Funding excluded only if
    no accepted trade intersects a funding settlement and verified after run.
